il a cab.","2":"Have the car towed and call a cab.","3":"Call a friend for a ride.","4":"Check if other flights exist later in the day.","5":"Contact the organizer of the safari to explain that he may be delayed.","6":"R_7CyjUM1lnYTRXWr"},"93":{"1":"Consider nearby help.","2":"Contact the airline.","3":"Call for roadside assistance.","4":"Assess the car trouble.","5":"Explore alternative transportation.","6":"R_7FQCwzL61mqIGfl"},"94":{"1":"Flag down a car on the highway and ask it to take him to the airport.","2":"Rely on his speed and run to the airport if he's close.","3":"Fix his car if he has the tools to do so.","4":"Call a tow truck and ask them to drop him off at the airport.","5":"Call a taxi to the airport.","6":"R_7Fyi9b5fRdcmEUN"},"95":{"1":"Call anyone around the area who can help.","2":"Pick an Uber.","3":"Call the insurance company.","4":"Postpone the trip.","5":"Try fixing the car himself.","6":"R_7JfFwcDJP35Hzln"},"96":{"1":"Call a family member.","2":"Call a friend.","3":"Book another flight.","4":"Not go at all.","5":"Postpone the trip altogether.","6":"R_7LbbH6CJBhzkj6m"},"97":{"1":"Tow truck.","2":"Cab.","3":"Call a friend.","4":"Cancel his flight.","5":"Hitchhike to the airport.","6":"R_7QSNb7GnKmUekTZ"},"98":{"1":"Josh could call a friend.","2":"Josh could cancel his flight.","3":"Josh could call an Uber to the airport.","4":"Josh could call his car insurance company for assistance.","5":"Josh could wave to other cars for help.","6":"R_7RWZAFS8RAkbZRv"},"99":{"1":"Call a rideshare or taxi service.","2":"Request Roadside Assistance for His Car.","3":"Contact a Friend or Family Member.","4":"Flag Down a Passing Vehicle.","5":"Arrange airport parking for his car.","6":"R_7SxpkpXtIoUbFSN"},"100":{"1":"Check on the status of the flight time.","2":"Call the airline to see if he can make it.","3":"Call the airline to see if there is another flight.","4":"Cry.","5":"Go home.","6":"R_7TYuRV0fo2RuQFb"},"101":{"1":"Call a friend.","2":"Call in's company."