ed in the study information and used worldwide.&nbsp;<\/li><br><li>I consent to my anonymized research data being available for scientific analysis in the\n    Open Science Framework as described in the study information, even after the end of the\n    study.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n  <\/section>\n\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Consent_2","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"9. Data Protection Consent I have read and understood the study information. I have been informed...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1011"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6QJc0lBxS7XQcKi","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1012","SecondaryAttribute":"\u00a0\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Consent_dp","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\u00a0\u00a0","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes, I agree"},"2":{"Display":"No, I don't agree"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1012"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6QJc0lBxS7XQcKi","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1013","SecondaryAttribute":"Reminder: Heinz's wife has recently fallen ill and needs an expensive medication that is not cove...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5; margin:0;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#000000;\">\n    <em>Reminder:<\/em>\n  <\/span>\n<\/p>\n<br>\n<div style=\"background-color: #B3E5FC; padding: 20px; border-radius: 