:{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the following scenario: Josh is on the way to the airport to catch a flight to a hunt...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e2e82202-1191-c883-193c-54248306695a\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><em>Please read the following scenario:<\/em><br \/>\nJosh is on the way to the airport to catch a flight to a hunting safari in Africa. He knows that he has left with plenty of time to make it there, but his car breaks down on the highway. Now Josh is sitting in his car near a busy intersection, and knows he needs to get to the airport soon if he is going to catch his flight.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Scenario2","QuestionID":"QID798","QuestionJS":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6QJc0lBxS7XQcKi","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID799","SecondaryAttribute":"In this situation, here are five actions that a previous participant believed Josh could do. \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>In this situation, here are five actions that a previous participant believed Josh could do.<\/b><\/div>\n&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px; background-color: #B2D8D8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px; text-align: justify;\">\n  <span style=\"color:#000000; font-family: Georgia, serif;\">${lm:\/\/Field\/1}<\/span>\n<\/div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div style=\"margin-